DESCRIPTION:All In Favor Play Reading with David Templeton &amp\; Local St
 udents Friday\, April 17\, 2026 6:00pm – 8:00pm Free Admission\, Please 
 RSVP Below Join local playwright David Templeton for a reading of one of h
 is newest works\, All in Favor\, in which a group of high school students 
 race to complete a Bicentennial tile mosaic portraying the signing of the 
 Declaration of Independence\, only to face chaos when their leader drops o
 ut and a conflict-averse newcomer joins. As a school board funding freeze 
 forces them to make the artwork “more American”\, the students must na
 vigate artistic freedom\, personal clashes\, and philosophical debates abo
 ut independence to finish their masterpiece on time. This will be a table 
 reading of the first act.&nbsp\; .fe-block-a9d32510319898924a12 {mix-blend
